        "original_id": "18685087-e338-5340-bdbf-625dc5e77e44",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Somerville, Limbo, Inside\n- Companies: Jumpship, Playdead\n- Topics: indie video games, puzzle-platform games, spiritual successors\n\nFacts:\n- In July 2010, Playdead released Limbo on Xbox Live Arcade.\n- After its July 2010 Xbox Live Arcade release, Limbo was ported to several other systems, including PlayStation 3 and Microsoft Windows.\n- Limbo is a puzzle-platform video game developed by the independent studio Playdead.\n- Inside is the spiritual successor to Playdead's 2010 game Limbo and features similar 2.5D gameplay.\n- Somerville is an upcoming video game and the debut title by the indie studio Jumpship.",
